+# S5-CLM-00003488
+
+This directory is the target-local handoff for the second-kind Cunningham-chain
+infinitude conjecture, owned only by `S5CON-00003488-TARGET--worker`.
+
+The package binds the exact source declaration and preserves its open status.
+`Statement.lean` transports the source recurrence and proposition;
+`Proof.lean` contains checked transport and finite sanity lemmas;
+`Exploration.lean` and `research/attempt-001.json` record bounded positive-budget
+exploration; the resolution, human, machine, readability, and validation
+receipts describe the remaining debt.
+
+Current state: **exploration package accepted pending canonical Master review**.
+The conjecture is not proved or refuted. Mapping, human, machine, and root
+resolution cuts remain open, so no underscore-to-x transition is authorized.
+
+Start with `intake.json`, `statement-crosswalk.json`, `frontier.md`, and
+`full-study.md`. Artifact hashes and the frozen self-test handoff are in the
+worker outbox under the task-local work root.
